      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step: GetPalletQuantity (DataCollectionSteps = 4)\n\n• Input: numeric (positive integer)\n• Saves to SkidQuantity AND ClaimedQuantity on current skid\n• Combo skid: after first qty → ComboSkidActiveSkidIndex = 1 → re-show PartNumber for skid 2\n• Advance → GetSkidWeight (5)\n\nRight Panel: PalletInfoDisplay (4-column table, 7 rows)\n• Updates live as data collected\n• Shows Employee, Model, FAS Cell, Qty, Weight, Tolerance, Delta\n• Labels bold when in data-entry mode",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step: GetPalletQuantity (DataCollectionSteps = 4)\n\n• Input: numeric (positive integer)\n• Saves to SkidQuantity AND ClaimedQuantity on current skid\n• Combo skid: after first qty → ComboSkidActiveSkidIndex = 1 → re-show PartNumber for skid 2\n• Advance → GetSkidWeight (5)\n\nRight Panel: PalletInfoDisplay (4-column table, 7 rows)\n• Updates live as data collected\n• Shows Employee, Model, FAS Cell, Qty, Weight, Tolerance, Delta\n• Labels bold when in data-entry mode",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
